OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-used park and ride could
OL,4,Aserve Eden Project Morecambe, says
OL,5,Acouncillor
OL,6,
OL,7,FA park and ride which is under threat
OL,8,Fof being scrapped could serve Eden
OL,9,FProject Morecambe, a councillor has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FLancashire County Council's cabinet has
OL,13,Fagreed to carry out a consultation on
OL,14,Fthe potential closure of Caton Road in
OL,15,FLancaster, as well as Walton-le Dale
OL,16,Fnear Preston.
OL,18,FThe authority said the sites cost about
OL,19,F#550,000 a year to operate and their
OL,20,Fuse was "well below capacity" but a
OL,21,Ffinal decision was yet to be made.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
